<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 300s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 4th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 300s BCE, 485 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 133 were founded and 83 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Punic Empire, the Roman Republic and the State of Chu.</p></header>
